<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea First Bank 1996 net profit shrinks.</title>
<headline>Korea First Bank 1996 net profit shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				38     vs     106</p>
<p>    Net				    6.25     vs   17.43</p>
<p>    Operating Revenue	     2,461.7     vs 2,337.9</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		  9.14     vs   23.69</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won, in cash)</p>
<p>						 1.0    vs    none</p>
<p>NOTE- The share capital of Korea First Bank stood unchanged at 164 million shares.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
